# Safety net only: the local admin tool now lives OUTSIDE this
# site folder, next to it, so Vercel never sees it anyway. This
# line protects the case where the folder is ever copied inside.
_local-admin
# Developer and review files: they are not part of the website
# and must not be served on the live site. They stay in the
# repository folder for your own use, but Vercel will not deploy
# them. Note: .vercelignore only affects the Vercel deployment;
# these files are still visible in the GitHub repository itself
# if you push the whole folder.
tools
data-review-board.md
data-review-olevel.md
apps-script-notify.gs
# Internal operations doc: it describes the admin workflow, bank
# structure and cache rules, so it must not be served on the live
# site. It stays in the folder for your own use; Vercel will not
# deploy it. (Same caveat as the files above: this only affects
# Vercel, not GitHub.)
README.txt
